WEBVTT

00:05:57.312 --> 00:06:00.733
which was introduced in 1971.

00:06:00.757 --> 00:06:03.355
Carolyn Davidson,
a graphic design student,

00:06:03.379 --> 00:06:08.373
originally created the logo
for 35 dollars.

00:06:09.396 --> 00:06:14.765
Upon seeing it,
Nike CEO Phil Knight stated,

00:06:14.789 --> 00:06:16.487
"I don't love it

00:06:16.511 --> 00:06:19.910
but maybe it will grow on me."

00:06:19.934 --> 00:06:22.012
Maybe it will grow on me.

00:06:22.621 --> 00:06:24.958
But why is the swoosh so popular?

00:06:24.982 --> 00:06:26.806
Why is the swoosh so popular?

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.439
Is it the mark?

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.994
Or is the marketing?